    <string name="empty_here">The phone\'s folder is empty, though it had files. Nothing was deleted on the server. If you emptied it on purpose, empty the Nextcloud folder too.</string>
    <string name="empty_there">The Nextcloud folder is empty or missing, though it had files. Nothing was deleted on the phone. If you emptied it on purpose, empty the phone\'s folder too.</string>
